<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1361618" n="1"/>
  <p><lb/>Viro <abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-119166895">Nicolao Bernoull<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></rs>
      <lb/><rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-102552517">Petrus <abbr>Anto.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr> Michelotti</rs> <abbr>S. P. D.</abbr></p>
  <p><lb/>Ex litteris <abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-117589144">Patruelis</rs> Tui <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>a dato</expan></choice> <date when="1720-04-02">2 Aprilis</date>
      <lb/>ad me datis intellexi eum propedi<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> <rs type="place" key="place_VER-repven">Venetias</rs>
      <lb/>fuisse profectur<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, ut sperem jam jam me ill<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>visur<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> atque amplexurum. Promisit se delatu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>r<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> me<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_M3G2JA79">Dissertation<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice></rs> cum Annotationibus <abbr>Ce<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>leberr.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-118509969">Patrui</rs>. Statim ac ipse huc pervenerit
      <lb/>Te certior<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> faciam. Interim ut memoriam te<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>neas nostr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> amiciti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> nunquam delend<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <subst><del>oro</del><add>oro,</add></subst>
      <lb/>et si quid de rebus Geometricis editurus es, me
      <lb/>certior<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> facias obsecro.</p> <closer><salute>Vale plurim<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> vale Vir
      <lb/>Amicissime, et salut<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> plurim<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> dicito meo no<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mine <abbr>Celeber.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr> <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-118509969">Patruo</rs> Tuo.</salute>
      <lb/><dateline>Dabam <rs type="place" key="place_VER-repven">Venetiis</rs>
      <lb/><date when="1720-05-03"><choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>a dato</expan></choice> 3 Maij 1720.</date></dateline></closer>
</div>
</body>
</text></TEI>